{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/vista-del-mar-eva-real-estate-yas-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":620,"crm_id":"552","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Vista Del Mar","slug":"vista-del-mar-eva-real-estate-yas-island","display_address":"Yas Island","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Esnad Management","price":1226600,"display_price":"1.226M","lattitude":24.431301,"longitude":54.6264239,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Vista Del Mar - an exclusive project by Eva Real Estate on Yas Island in Abu Dhabi. The facades are designed in a modern style with light and dark ceramics with wooden inserts from sea teak, in the interior decoration used such materials as stone, ceramics and wood. The complex offers a wide range of luxury apartments with <strong>1-4 bedrooms.</strong></p><p>Residents are presented with premium amenities and world-class services, including access to a private beach, swimming pool, gym and fitness center, children's playground. The grounds feature a large landscaped park with seating and barbecue areas, 24-hour security, parking and electric vehicle charging stations.Restaurants, shopping and entertainment venues are within walking distance.</p><p>Vista Del Mar is located in the heart of Yas Island. Yas Beach Club and Etihad Arena are just 2 minutes away, Yas Bay Waterfront, Yas Mall and the entertainment complexes of Ferrari World and Warner Bros World can be reached in 10 minutes and Dubai is approximately 35 minutes away.</p><p>Vista Del Mar is a true luxury paradise for personal and family living and will also be a profitable and lucrative investment for the future.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off